# NanCodeAgent — Project Constraints

Software-engineering recommendation project: **independently design and implement a coding agent** (simplified Claude Code / Codex / OpenCode / DeepSeek Harness style).

**Deadline:** 2026-09-02 24:00 Beijing time (i.e. 2026-09-03 00:00).

## Goal

Agent talks to an LLM, **autonomously** reads/writes files and runs commands to finish programming tasks the user assigns.

## Hard bans

- Do **not** wrap an existing agent product UI.
- Do **not** use agent frameworks/SDKs: LangChain, LlamaIndex, OpenAI Agents SDK, Claude Agent SDK, AutoGen, CrewAI, etc.
- Do **not** rely on hosted server-side code execution or file tools (Code Interpreter, Files API, etc.).

## Allowed

- Model vendor API client libraries, OpenAI-compatible gateways, native **tool calling**.
- Any model, any language; AI-assisted coding is OK — own every design decision.

## Must implement yourself (local harness)

- Conversation history & context management
- Tool definitions & **local** execution
- Model output parsing
- Agent loop & stop conditions
- Error handling

## Secrets

- API keys only via env vars or **non-committed** config.
- Never put credentials in the repo, README, docs, demos, or videos.
- If leaked: revoke and rotate immediately.
